# Dataset

Download **creditcard.csv** from Kaggle:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mlg-ulb/creditcardfraud

and place it in this folder as `data/creditcard.csv`.

- 284,807 transactions made by European cardholders in September 2013
- 492 frauds (0.172%) -> extremely imbalanced
- Columns: `Time`, `V1`-`V28` (PCA-transformed), `Amount`, `Class` (1 = fraud)

The file is not committed because it is too large for a normal GitHub repo.
